# scripts/opcount: `llmbench bench policy N` asks N times by Generate
# through Metered{Retry{Fallback{Scripted}}} (wf10 L2), each a one-delta
# reply that succeeds at once; the cost of one ask is the slope between
# the two sizes. The control is hand Go: a script function, a fallback
# loop, a retry loop with a switch on the error's class, and a usage sum.
# The floor is the inner call and one compare per wrapper.
unit ask
sizes 200000 1200000
args bench policy {n}
control benchmarks/llm/testdata/control
floor benchmarks/llm/testdata/floor
